                    "path" : "terminationChatPrompt",
                    "value" : "{\n    \"question\": \"#{*payload/prompt}\",\n    \"answer\": \"#{response}\" \n}\n\nJust check in above JSON if question and its answer is relevant if yes then reply the keyword \"SUBMIT-REPORT\" Only. Otherwise respond with the concerns so that the manager agent can fix the issues. Also, make sure not to keep pushing manager agent if the response can't me sufficient due to some data shortage or technical reason. But you must suggest some strategies to improve the response. if there is not concern make sure to respond with only one single keyword \"SUBMIT-REPORT\".",
